!>
!>    S(r) = -log PD(r)
!>
!> (interior negative, matching the SvdW sign convention).  Both terms depend on
!> r only through the displacements d_a = r - r_a (and d_b = r - r_b):
!>
!>    d/dr_i   = d/d(d_a)_i + d/d(d_b)_i
!>    d/dr_A,i = -d/d(d_A)_i
!>
